01:08.724 --> 01:11.000
both: Dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
两者：运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:11.068 --> 01:12.896
dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:12.965 --> 01:13.896
