both: Dribble, dribble,
- 啊啊！
两者：运球，运球，

01:13.965 --> 01:15.482
dribble, dribble.
运球，运球。

01:15.551 --> 01:17.206
Dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble.
运球，运球，
运球，运球。

01:17.275 --> 01:18.517
Dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble.
运球，运球，
运球，运球。

01:18.586 --> 01:19.793
- Agh!
- 啊啊！

01:19.862 --> 01:21.206
both: Dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
两者：运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:21.275 --> 01:22.862
- It's been ten minutes!
- 已经十分钟了！

01:22.931 --> 01:24.551
Ain't you gonna shoot?
你不打算开枪吗？

01:26.241 --> 01:28.344
both: Dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
两者：运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:28.413 --> 01:31.000
dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:31.068 --> 01:34.551
dribble, dribble,
dribble, dribble,
运球，运球，
运球，运球，

01:34.620 --> 01:37.724
dribble, dribble--
运球，运球——

01:37.793 --> 01:40.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:40.620 --> 01:43.241
- Sorry, but you boys
were slower
- 抱歉，你们这些孩子
速度较慢

01:43.310 --> 01:45.206
than a Sunday afternoon.
比周日下午。

01:45.275 --> 01:48.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:48.137 --> 01:50.965
On your mark,
get set, eat!
在你的标记上，
摆好姿势，吃饭！

01:51.034 --> 01:54.241
[anticipatory vocalizations]
[预期发声]

01:56.517 --> 01:59.448
[elegant pizzicato music]
[优雅的拨奏音乐]

01:59.517 --> 02:02.793
- Wow, you two are off
like a herd of turtles.
- 哇，你们两个走了
就像一群乌龟。

02:02.862 --> 02:04.655
Watch this!
注意这个！

02:04.724 --> 02:07.655
[frantic ukulele music]
[疯狂的尤克里里音乐]

02:07.724 --> 02:14.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:21.068 --> 02:24.241
I win.
我赢了。

02:24.310 --> 02:27.241
[dejected music]
[沮丧的音乐]

02:27.310 --> 02:29.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:29.655 --> 02:31.172
Hot dang!
热当当！

02:31.241 --> 02:33.517
I'm faster than green grass
through a goose!
我比绿草还快
通过一只鹅！

02:33.586 --> 02:36.586
Hm, these jumbo dogs
are much too big
嗯，这些巨型狗
太大了

02:36.655 --> 02:38.758
for your baby heads.
为了你的宝宝头。

02:38.827 --> 02:40.931
[frantic music]
[疯狂的音乐]

02:41.000 --> 02:43.137
These dinky dogs
should do ya.
这些小狗狗
应该做你。

02:43.206 --> 02:45.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:45.103 --> 02:47.034
both: [muffled] Thank you.
两人：[低声]谢谢。

02:47.103 --> 02:49.793
- You're welcome!
- 不客气！

02:49.862 --> 02:52.793
[upbeat rock music]
[欢快的摇滚乐]

02:52.862 --> 02:59.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:00.034 --> 03:02.896
I win again!
我又赢了！

03:02.965 --> 03:04.517
That's right!
这是正确的！

03:04.586 --> 03:06.172
[all yelling, groaning]
[所有人大喊大叫，呻吟]

03:06.241 --> 03:08.793
I own all of y'all!
我拥有你们所有人！

03:08.862 --> 03:10.137
Yeehaw!
耶哈！

03:10.206 --> 03:12.206
- Sandy, don't you think
you're playing
- 桑迪，你不觉得吗
你正在玩

03:12.275 --> 03:14.137
a teensy-weensy bit rough?
有点粗糙？

03:14.206 --> 03:15.862
Just a smidge?
Hm?
只是一点点？
嗯？

03:15.931 --> 03:19.586
- Aww, I'm actually going
a little easy on you guys,
- 哇哦，我真的要去
对你们稍微宽松一点

03:19.655 --> 03:22.689
seein' as how
you're all so delicate.
看看如何
你们都是那么的脆弱。

03:22.758 --> 03:25.448
[all yell]
[全都喊]

03:25.517 --> 03:29.310
Hey, who wants to play
"dodge the chum"?
嘿嘿，谁想玩啊
“躲开密友”？

03:29.379 --> 03:32.275
- No, I don't think I'm--
[gibbers]
- 不，我不认为我是--
[胡言乱语]

03:32.344 --> 03:35.310
Sandy is really
stressing me out today.
桑迪确实是
今天让我压力很大。

03:35.379 --> 03:38.931
You want to go jellyfishing?
你想去捉水母吗？

03:39.000 --> 03:41.827
- No, I'd rather
go jellyfishing.
- 不，我宁愿
去钓水母。

03:41.896 --> 03:45.000
- You sure you don't wanna go
jellyfishing?
- 你确定你不想去
捕水母？

03:45.068 --> 03:46.896
- I said no.
- 我说不。

03:46.965 --> 03:49.517
I wanna go jellyfishing.
我想去钓水母。

03:49.586 --> 03:52.689
- Okay, we'll do
what you want.
- 好的，我们会做的
你想要什么。

03:52.758 --> 03:55.793
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

03:56.241 --> 03:57.793
- The name is Sandy Cheeks,
- 我的名字是桑迪·奇克斯，

03:57.862 --> 04:02.137
and I can lick any critter
on any beach!
我可以舔任何小动物
在任何海滩上！

04:02.206 --> 04:03.655
[carefree orchestral music]
[悠闲的管弦乐]

04:03.724 --> 04:06.655
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

04:06.724 --> 04:08.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:08.931 --> 04:10.620
- Now this is fun!
- 现在这很有趣！

04:10.689 --> 04:13.206
- [mock RP accent] Yes, quite
the civilized sport, eh, what?
- [模拟 RP 口音] 是的，相当
文明体育，呃，什么？

04:13.275 --> 04:14.862
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:14.931 --> 04:16.482
[mock RP accent] I say,
[模拟 RP 口音]我说，

04:16.551 --> 04:20.344
No more rough-horsing.
[laughs]
别再胡闹了。
[笑]

04:20.413 --> 04:23.172
- [Southern accent] And no more
you-know-who
- [南方口音] 没有了
神秘人

04:23.241 --> 04:25.344
killing the casual vibe.
破坏了休闲的氛围。

04:25.413 --> 04:26.931
[both yell]
- Hey, guys!
[两人大喊]
- 嘿，伙计们！

04:27.000 --> 04:28.896
[both gibber]
[两人都胡言乱语]

04:28.965 --> 04:30.586
- Mind if I join you?
- 介意我加入吗？

04:30.655 --> 04:32.413
both: [weakly] Not at all.
两人：[弱弱地]一点也不。

04:32.482 --> 04:34.068
- Great!
I can't wait to kick
- 伟大的！
我已经等不及要踢了

04:34.137 --> 04:36.655
some jelly booty!
一些果冻战利品！

04:36.724 --> 04:39.482
- Uh, the thing is, Sandy,
in jellyfishing,
- 呃，问题是，桑迪，
在捕捉水母的过程中，

04:39.551 --> 04:41.517
we don't play to kick booty.
我们玩游戏不是为了赚钱。

04:41.586 --> 04:45.068
We actually catch and release
the little sea angels.
我们实际上捕获并释放
小海天使们。

04:45.137 --> 04:46.793
- Well, that sounds
about as exciting
- 嗯，听起来
大约同样令人兴奋

04:46.862 --> 04:48.103
as tap water soup.
作为自来水汤。

04:48.172 --> 04:50.344
Oh, well.
Your game, your rules.
那好吧。
你的游戏，你的规则。

04:50.413 --> 04:52.827
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

04:52.896 --> 04:54.275
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

04:54.344 --> 04:55.793
[sprightly orchestral music]
【轻快的管弦乐】

04:55.862 --> 04:57.793
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:57.862 --> 05:00.620
- [laughs]
He's in mine now!
- [笑]
他现在在我的里面了！

05:00.689 --> 05:02.931
- [laughs]
Now he's in mine!
- [笑]
现在他在我的里面了！

05:03.000 --> 05:04.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:04.448 --> 05:06.517
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:06.586 --> 05:09.448
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

05:09.517 --> 05:12.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:12.620 --> 05:15.275
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:15.344 --> 05:19.206
- [flatly] Whoopee.
[growls]
- [平淡]哎呀。
[咆哮]

05:19.275 --> 05:21.448
[yells]
Whoo-hoo!
[喊叫]
呼呼！

05:21.517 --> 05:23.655
You're gonna look good
mounted on my wall!
你会看起来不错
安装在我的墙上！

05:23.724 --> 05:26.310
- Uh-uh.
Catch and release, Sandy.
- 呃呃。
抓住然后释放，桑迪。

05:26.379 --> 05:28.689
- Hm.
- 嗯。

05:28.758 --> 05:30.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:30.689 --> 05:36.103
- Well, this is lamer
than a paper sandwich.
- 嗯，这是拉默
比纸三明治。

05:36.172 --> 05:37.896
Hey!
Ooh!
嘿！
哦！

05:37.965 --> 05:39.448
This one's fat as a tick!
这个胖得像蜱虫一样！

05:39.517 --> 05:41.448
Ha, ha!
Got you!
哈，哈！
明白了！

05:41.517 --> 05:43.517
- Huh.
The jelly-thingies
- 嗯。
果冻状的东西

05:43.586 --> 05:45.137
were here a minute ago.
一分钟前还在这里。

05:45.206 --> 05:47.551
- It isn't like them
to be so... coy.
- 这不像他们
如此……腼腆。

05:47.620 --> 05:49.482
- [laughs]
[shudders]
- [笑]
[颤抖]

05:49.551 --> 05:51.344
[laughs] I guess they must've--
[shudders]
[笑]我想他们一定是——
[颤抖]

05:51.413 --> 05:53.310
Gotten sick of the boring game!
厌倦了无聊的游戏！

05:53.379 --> 05:55.586
[shudders]
[颤抖]

05:55.655 --> 05:57.931
Hm?
Mm!
嗯？
毫米！

05:58.000 --> 05:59.517
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:59.586 --> 06:01.551
Get in here,
you slimy varmint!
进入这里，
你这个粘糊糊的害虫！

06:01.620 --> 06:03.724
Hm?
- SpongeBob, look!
嗯？
- 海绵宝宝，看！

06:03.793 --> 06:06.413
How's it going, little guy?
怎么样，小家伙？

06:06.482 --> 06:07.758
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:07.827 --> 06:10.103
So that's how you wanna
play it.
所以这就是你想要的
玩它。

06:10.172 --> 06:13.517
[dark music]
[黑暗音乐]

06:13.586 --> 06:16.241
[sprightly orchestral music]
【轻快的管弦乐】

06:16.310 --> 06:19.137
Hi-ya!
嗨呀！

06:19.206 --> 06:21.551
I'm catching and releasing--
我抓住并释放——

06:21.620 --> 06:24.241
releasing them
from their freedom!
释放他们
脱离他们的自由！

06:24.310 --> 06:26.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:26.068 --> 06:27.862
- Hey, widdle jewwy bewwy.
- 嘿，犹太犹太人。

06:27.931 --> 06:28.965
Would you mind?
你会介意的？

06:29.034 --> 06:31.000
- [grunts]
Mine!
- [咕哝]
我的！

06:31.068 --> 06:33.137
[laughs]
[笑]

06:33.206 --> 06:35.793
- What?
Ugh.
- 什么？
啊。

06:35.862 --> 06:37.379
- Yeah!
- 是的！

06:37.448 --> 06:39.413
[chuckles]
Easier than slipping
[笑声]
比滑倒还容易

06:39.482 --> 06:40.586
down a mudslide!
滑下泥石流！

06:40.655 --> 06:42.379
[jellyfish buzz]
Okay, okay.
[水母嗡嗡声]
好吧，好吧。

06:42.448 --> 06:44.965
I know.
Catch and release.
我知道。
抓住并释放。

06:45.034 --> 06:47.793
[energetic music]
[充满活力的音乐]

06:47.862 --> 06:50.758
Isn't there anything more
to this game?
难道还有什么吗
到这个游戏？

06:50.827 --> 06:52.586
- What more can anyone want?
- 任何人还想要什么？

06:52.655 --> 06:54.689
- Yeah, it's perfect!
- 是的，太完美了！

06:54.758 --> 06:57.275
- I have an idea how we can...
- 我有一个想法，我们怎样才能...

06:57.344 --> 06:59.310
kick things up a notch!
让事情更上一层楼！

06:59.379 --> 07:00.724
- Hey, Sandy,
I really don't think
- 嘿，桑迪，
我真的不认为

07:00.793 --> 07:03.517
we need to kick anything up
any notches.
我们需要把一切都搞起来
任何凹口。

07:03.586 --> 07:06.965
- Ha!
Frankenstein Fish Food!
- 哈！
弗兰肯斯坦鱼食！

07:07.034 --> 07:09.000
Ooh, this should be fun!
哦，这应该很有趣！

07:09.068 --> 07:10.965
[chuckles]
[笑声]

07:11.034 --> 07:13.965
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:14.034 --> 07:15.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:15.103 --> 07:17.172
[jellyfish start]
[水母开始]

07:17.241 --> 07:24.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:27.206 --> 07:30.413
Ha, ha!
That's what I'm talking about!
哈，哈！
这就是我要说的！

07:30.482 --> 07:32.103
They're no longer jellyfish.
它们不再是水母了。

07:32.172 --> 07:35.137
Now they're jelly-buzz saws!
现在它们是果冻锯！

07:35.206 --> 07:39.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:39.758 --> 07:40.931
- [yells]
- [大喊]

07:41.000 --> 07:42.689
- Ah!
Oh.
- 啊！
哦。

07:42.758 --> 07:43.896
Hey!
嘿！

07:43.965 --> 07:47.896
You're supposed to fly
into there!
你应该飞翔
到那里去！

07:47.965 --> 07:49.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:49.275 --> 07:51.137
Hm?
嗯？

07:51.206 --> 07:53.931
[grunting, straining]
[咕哝，用力]

07:54.000 --> 07:56.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:56.103 --> 07:59.034
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:59.103 --> 08:01.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:01.103 --> 08:03.862
I'm a walking glow stick!
我是行走的荧光棒！

08:03.931 --> 08:05.344
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:05.413 --> 08:07.689
- Whoa, Nelly, little jelly!
- 哇，耐莉，小果冻！

08:07.758 --> 08:10.448
[yelling, gibbering]
[大喊大叫，胡言乱语]

08:10.517 --> 08:12.551
Ow.
噢。

08:12.620 --> 08:16.275
Such a soothing pastime.
这是一种令人舒缓的消遣。

08:16.344 --> 08:18.206
[rousing orchestral music]
[振奋人心的管弦乐]

08:18.275 --> 08:20.965
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

08:21.034 --> 08:23.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:23.275 --> 08:25.034
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:25.103 --> 08:27.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:27.482 --> 08:30.482
- Thank you, super Sandy!
- 谢谢你，超级桑迪！

08:30.551 --> 08:34.448
- Welcome to
the jellyfish rodeo!
- 欢迎来到
水母竞技！

08:34.517 --> 08:36.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:36.310 --> 08:37.413
Aha!
啊哈！

08:37.482 --> 08:39.482
Gotcha, varmint!
明白了，害虫！

08:39.551 --> 08:42.413
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

08:42.482 --> 08:45.344
- [yells]
- [大喊]

08:45.413 --> 08:48.068
- Hey, that is not
how we do it.
- 嘿，那不是
我们如何做。

08:48.137 --> 08:52.310
[gibbering]
[胡言乱语]

08:52.379 --> 08:53.793
Carry on.
继续。

08:53.862 --> 08:55.862
- Hands off that jellyfish,
SpongeBob!
- 放开那只水母
海绵宝宝！

08:55.931 --> 08:57.413
He's mine!
他是我的！

08:57.482 --> 09:00.172
Oh, you are so mine!
哦，你真是我的人！

09:00.241 --> 09:02.896
- No...
Problem.
- 没问题。

09:02.965 --> 09:04.758
Oy.
哎哟。

09:04.827 --> 09:07.965
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:08.034 --> 09:11.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:11.448 --> 09:14.655
- You're out!
- 你出去了！

09:14.724 --> 09:16.965
Hit the showers!
去淋浴吧！

09:17.034 --> 09:19.448
Hm?
嗯？

09:19.517 --> 09:21.724
Time for spring cleaning!
春季大扫除的时间到了！

09:21.793 --> 09:24.724
[frantic music]
[疯狂的音乐]

09:24.793 --> 09:32.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:32.344 --> 09:37.517
Into the dustbin
of history!
进垃圾箱
历史！

09:37.586 --> 09:39.931
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:40.000 --> 09:41.000
Heh.
呵呵。

09:41.068 --> 09:44.000
[ululates]
[哀嚎]

09:44.068 --> 09:46.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:46.758 --> 09:48.724
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

09:48.793 --> 09:51.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:51.758 --> 09:54.275
- Ha!
Hoo-ah!
- 哈！
呼啊！

09:54.344 --> 09:56.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:56.931 --> 09:59.206
Hyah!
哈！

09:59.275 --> 10:06.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:06.620 --> 10:09.931
Whammer, bammer,
in the slammer!
猛击，猛击，
在猛烈撞击中！

10:10.000 --> 10:12.206
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

10:12.275 --> 10:14.620
I'm the queen
of Jellyfish Fields!
我是女王
水母田！

10:14.689 --> 10:18.413
How does that feel, losers?
失败者们，感觉如何？

10:18.482 --> 10:20.517
- [hoarsely] I don't like it.
- [沙哑]我不喜欢它。

10:20.586 --> 10:22.758
[quiet ukulele music]
[安静的尤克里里音乐]

10:22.827 --> 10:24.482
- I can't see or hear you,
- 我看不到或听不到你

10:24.551 --> 10:27.551
for my face
has been cauterized.
为了我的脸
已被烧灼。

10:27.620 --> 10:29.241
- Ah, you guys are just
out of shape.
- 啊，你们只是
变形了。

10:29.310 --> 10:31.137
Come on,
best two out of three.
来吧，
三分之二最好。

10:31.206 --> 10:32.689
- [wheezes]
- [喘息声]

10:32.758 --> 10:35.551
- [strains]
- [菌株]

10:35.620 --> 10:38.689
But you've got
all the jellyfish.
但你有
所有的水母。

10:38.758 --> 10:41.482
- And there's no more field.
- 没有更多的领域了。

10:41.551 --> 10:44.172
- [gasps]
Oh?
- [喘气]
哦？

10:44.241 --> 10:45.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:45.931 --> 10:48.206
[laughs]
Did I do that?
[笑]
我这样做了吗？

10:48.275 --> 10:51.724
- [whines]
Yes.
- [哀嚎]
是的。

10:51.793 --> 10:54.206
- You did this, too.
- 你也这么做了。

10:54.275 --> 10:57.620
- I guess I can be
overly competitive at times.
- 我想我可以
有时竞争过度。

10:57.689 --> 10:59.931
- Gee, you think?
- 哎呀，你觉得呢？

11:00.000 --> 11:01.517
Ow!
Ow!
噢！
噢！

11:01.586 --> 11:02.793
Gah!
嘎！

11:02.862 --> 11:05.724
- You guys'll be all right
- 你们会没事的

11:05.793 --> 11:07.758
if you just walk it off.
如果你只是走开它。

11:07.827 --> 11:10.965
[dejected ukulele music]
[沮丧的尤克里里音乐]

11:11.034 --> 11:12.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:12.137 --> 11:14.310
- Don't forget
to release 'em.
- 别忘了
释放他们。

11:14.379 --> 11:15.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:15.551 --> 11:17.862
- Oh? Hm?
[gasps]
- 哦？嗯？
[喘气]

11:17.931 --> 11:20.551
Yeah!
That problem is solved.
是的！
这个问题就解决了。

11:20.620 --> 11:24.551
Now to my other problem.
现在我的另一个问题。

11:24.620 --> 11:26.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:26.931 --> 11:30.517
Ah, I've got
some deep-dish thinking to do
啊，我有
一些深层次的思考要做

11:30.586 --> 11:32.551
about my aggressive ways.
关于我的攻击性方式。

11:32.620 --> 11:34.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:34.586 --> 11:36.620
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

11:36.689 --> 11:39.931
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

11:41.206 --> 11:43.275
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

11:43.344 --> 11:46.413
Om.
唵。

11:46.482 --> 11:49.275
Om.
唵。

11:49.344 --> 11:52.793
Om.
唵。

11:52.862 --> 11:59.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:59.068 --> 12:04.379
[gong crashes]
Om.
[锣声响起]
唵。

12:04.448 --> 12:09.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:10.000 --> 12:11.793
Om.
唵。

12:11.862 --> 12:17.275
Turns out, I'm the best
at relaxing, too.
事实证明我是最棒的
在放松时也是如此。

12:17.344 --> 12:20.448
- Om.
- 唵。

12:20.517 --> 12:23.758
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

12:26.379 --> 12:28.137
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

12:28.206 --> 12:30.655
- Oh, Sandy, help!
- It's horrible!
- 哦，桑迪，救命！
- 太可怕了！

12:30.724 --> 12:32.586
[both gibbering]
[两人都胡言乱语]

12:32.655 --> 12:34.551
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

12:34.620 --> 12:36.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:36.310 --> 12:38.827
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

12:38.896 --> 12:41.724
- Oh, Sandy, help!
It's--
- 哦，桑迪，救命！
它是 -

12:41.793 --> 12:43.793
[screams]
Oh.
[尖叫声]
哦。

12:43.862 --> 12:46.275
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

12:46.344 --> 12:47.517
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

12:47.586 --> 12:49.793
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

12:49.862 --> 12:51.689
- Ah, brother SpongeBob.
- 啊，海绵宝宝兄弟。

12:51.758 --> 12:53.379
Brother Patrick.
帕特里克兄弟。

12:53.448 --> 12:56.379
I bow to your good natures.
我向你的善良本性致敬。

12:56.448 --> 12:58.517
What can I do for you?
我能为你做什么？

12:58.586 --> 13:02.482
- You can clobber that
giant jellyfish monster thing!
- 你可以破坏它
巨型水母怪物！

13:02.551 --> 13:04.758
- Yeah, smash it up good!
=> - 是的，粉碎它好！

13:04.827 --> 13:06.724
- Oh, I couldn't do that.
- 哦，我做不到。

13:06.793 --> 13:08.689
I'm non-violent now.
我现在是非暴力的。

13:08.758 --> 13:10.793
I wouldn't hurt a fly-fish.
我不会伤害飞鱼。

13:10.862 --> 13:13.448
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

13:13.517 --> 13:16.448
[screaming]
[尖叫]

13:16.517 --> 13:18.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:18.379 --> 13:21.344
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

13:21.413 --> 13:23.689
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

13:23.758 --> 13:25.931
[roars]
[怒吼]

13:26.000 --> 13:29.758
- How about
some soothing music, jellyfish?
- 怎么样
一些舒缓的音乐，水母？

13:29.827 --> 13:33.000
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

13:34.689 --> 13:37.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:37.448 --> 13:40.655
A soothing sitar
always brings me peace.
舒缓的西塔琴
总是给我带来平静。

13:40.724 --> 13:44.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:44.310 --> 13:45.827
- Mm.
- 毫米。

13:45.896 --> 13:48.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:48.620 --> 13:50.275
- Oh!
- 哦！

13:50.344 --> 13:51.758
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

13:51.827 --> 13:54.413
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

13:54.482 --> 13:56.482
- Whoa!
Ow!
- 哇！
噢！

13:56.551 --> 13:58.620
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

13:58.689 --> 14:01.275
- Oh...
- 哦...

14:01.344 --> 14:05.551
The gongs!
They always calm me down.
锣！
他们总是让我平静下来。

14:05.620 --> 14:06.793
[jellyfish roars]
[水母咆哮]

14:06.862 --> 14:08.758
Ah!
啊!

14:08.827 --> 14:10.965
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

14:11.034 --> 14:12.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

14:12.931 --> 14:14.620
[gongs crash]
[锣声响起]

14:14.689 --> 14:16.517
Om.
唵。

14:16.586 --> 14:18.103
all: Om.
众：唵。

14:18.172 --> 14:22.689
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

14:22.758 --> 14:26.310
all: Om.
众：唵。

14:26.379 --> 14:30.000
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

14:34.758 --> 14:37.655
- [growls]
Okay, that does it.
- [咆哮]
好的，这样就可以了。

14:37.724 --> 14:41.862
I was a pacifist, but now
I'm gonna pass my fist
我曾经是一个和平主义者，但现在
我要递出我的拳头

14:41.931 --> 14:44.241
through your face!
通过你的脸！

14:44.310 --> 14:46.068
Mm.
毫米。

14:46.137 --> 14:49.586
As destroyer and transformer,
作为毁灭者和变形者，

14:49.655 --> 14:53.793
I transform to destroy you.
我变身就是为了毁灭你。

14:53.862 --> 14:58.068
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

14:58.137 --> 15:00.724
- Put up your dukes
and fight me like a squirrel!
- 摆出你的公爵
像松鼠一样与我战斗！

15:00.793 --> 15:03.482
[combative music]
[战斗音乐]

15:03.551 --> 15:06.724
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

15:06.793 --> 15:09.931
[yelling, grunting]
[大喊大叫，咕哝]

15:10.000 --> 15:13.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:13.862 --> 15:16.586
Hiya!
Oh!
嗨！
哦！

15:16.655 --> 15:20.655
[moans]
Whoa!
[呻吟声]
哇！

15:20.724 --> 15:22.724
- Sandy, catch!
- 桑迪，接住！

15:22.793 --> 15:24.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:24.206 --> 15:26.448
- The universe gave us
a terrible weapon
- 宇宙给了我们
可怕的武器

15:26.517 --> 15:28.793
made up of the darkest
dark matter
由最黑暗的组成
暗物质

15:28.862 --> 15:30.758
just for this occasion.
就为了这个场合。

15:30.827 --> 15:33.793
Ever played "dodge the chum"?
玩过“躲避密友”吗？

15:33.862 --> 15:36.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:36.275 --> 15:37.482
- Mm?
- 毫米？

15:37.551 --> 15:40.931
[roars]
[怒吼]

15:41.000 --> 15:43.586
- Hey, get your slimy mitts
off my pals!
- 嘿，拿起你的粘糊糊的手套
离开我的朋友们！

15:43.655 --> 15:45.344
Hiya!
Ya!
嗨！
呀！

15:45.413 --> 15:51.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:51.448 --> 15:53.068
Whoa!
哇！

15:53.137 --> 15:55.724
[growls]
Hiya!
[咆哮]
嗨！

15:55.793 --> 16:01.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:01.655 --> 16:03.793
Nothing.
That's it!
没有什么。
就是这样！

16:03.862 --> 16:06.103
[yells]
[喊叫]

16:06.172 --> 16:08.482
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

16:08.551 --> 16:11.586
Hm?
[yells]
嗯？
[喊叫]

16:11.655 --> 16:13.758
- Pretty.
- Oh...
- 漂亮的。
- 哦...

16:13.827 --> 16:16.758
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

16:16.827 --> 16:19.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:19.241 --> 16:21.689
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

16:21.758 --> 16:24.482
- Hm?
Oh.
- 嗯？
哦。

16:24.551 --> 16:26.482
- Mm.
- 毫米。

16:26.551 --> 16:28.482
- Who are my good
little jellies?
- 谁是我的好人
小果冻？

16:28.551 --> 16:30.137
You are.
你是。

16:30.206 --> 16:33.517
- Here you go.
Buy yourself something nice.
- 干得好。
给自己买点好东西吧

16:33.586 --> 16:35.068
- [obliging buzz]
- [嗡嗡声]

16:35.137 --> 16:37.137
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

16:37.206 --> 16:39.068
- Well, let's get
these little jellies
- 好吧，让我们开始吧
这些小果冻

16:39.137 --> 16:40.586
back to their home.
回到他们的家。

16:40.655 --> 16:43.379
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

16:43.448 --> 16:46.172
[laughs]
They really are sweet.
[笑]
他们真的很甜蜜。

16:46.241 --> 16:49.586
[shudders]
[growls]
[颤抖]
[咆哮]

16:49.655 --> 16:51.517
I'm gonna destroy you!
我要毁了你！

16:51.586 --> 16:53.482
[growls]
[咆哮]

16:53.551 --> 16:54.931
- That's our Sandy.
- 那是我们的桑迪。

16:55.000 --> 16:56.655
- Yeah.
Hm?
- 是的。
嗯？

16:56.724 --> 16:58.379
Which one's Sandy?
哪个是桑迪？

16:58.448 --> 16:59.758
[laughs]
[笑]

16:59.827 --> 17:08.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:11.034 --> 17:13.965
- [scatting]
- [分散]

17:14.034 --> 17:18.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:18.379 --> 17:19.586
Catch.
抓住。

17:19.655 --> 17:20.724
Oh, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot.
哦，热，热，热，热，热。

17:20.793 --> 17:22.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:22.586 --> 17:24.724
Ah!
Yow!
啊!
哟！

17:24.793 --> 17:28.413
Oh, oh!
Hot, hot, hot!
哦，哦！
热，热，热！

17:28.482 --> 17:30.344
Hot mustard!
热芥末！

17:30.413 --> 17:33.620
Oh! Oh! Whoa!
哦！哦！哇！

17:33.689 --> 17:35.137
- You mind?
Can't you see
- 你介意吗？
你看不到吗

17:35.206 --> 17:37.586
I'm trying to read here?
我想在这里读书？

17:37.655 --> 17:40.034
- Oh.
Oh.
- 哦。
哦。

17:40.103 --> 17:42.931
[intriguing music]
[有趣的音乐]

17:43.000 --> 17:44.758
- Hm?
[growls]
- 嗯？
[咆哮]

17:44.827 --> 17:47.758
- [scatting]
- [分散]

17:47.827 --> 17:53.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:53.793 --> 17:55.275
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

17:55.344 --> 17:57.103
- You have a loose thread.
- 你的线头松动了。

17:57.172 --> 18:00.482
- Hm?
So?
- 嗯？
所以？

18:00.551 --> 18:02.206
- I want to pull it.
- 我想拉它。

18:02.275 --> 18:04.068
- Hm.
If I let you pull it,
- 嗯。
如果我让你拉它

18:04.137 --> 18:07.482
will you please let me read
my book in peace?
请让我读一下好吗
我的书平安吗？

18:07.551 --> 18:08.655
- Mm-hm.
- 嗯嗯。

18:08.724 --> 18:10.620
- Fine.
Get it over with.
- 美好的。
快点结束吧。

18:10.689 --> 18:13.724
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

18:14.724 --> 18:17.655
[excited gibbering]
[兴奋的胡言乱语]

18:17.724 --> 18:20.655
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

18:20.724 --> 18:22.206
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

18:22.275 --> 18:24.068
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

18:24.137 --> 18:26.689
- Hm?
Ooh.
- 嗯？
哦。

18:26.758 --> 18:28.413
- Ah!
- 啊！

18:28.482 --> 18:30.517
[whines]
[哀鸣]

18:30.586 --> 18:32.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:32.379 --> 18:35.482
- [excited gibbering]
- [兴奋的胡言乱语]

18:35.551 --> 18:37.689
- [startled gasp]
- [惊呼]

18:37.758 --> 18:40.241
Nobody look down!
没有人往下看！

18:40.310 --> 18:43.862
- My leg of my pants!
- 我的裤腿！

18:43.931 --> 18:46.551
- Hm.
- 嗯。

18:46.620 --> 18:48.241
Seat yourself, sir.
坐下吧，先生。

18:48.310 --> 18:52.034
I'll be with you
in a minute.
我会和你在一起
一分钟后。

18:52.103 --> 18:54.379
[romantic orchestral music]
【浪漫的管弦乐】

18:54.448 --> 18:57.000
- Me most valuable possession,
- 我最宝贵的财产，

18:57.068 --> 18:59.620
except, of course,
当然，除了

18:59.689 --> 19:02.551
for you, my love.
为了你，我的爱人。

19:02.620 --> 19:03.827
Ah.
啊。

19:03.896 --> 19:06.827
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

19:06.896 --> 19:07.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:08.000 --> 19:09.034
[confused grunt]
[困惑的咕噜声]

19:09.103 --> 19:10.310
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:10.379 --> 19:12.620
Me appreciation
is depreciating!
我欣赏
正在贬值！

19:12.689 --> 19:14.000
Ah!
No!
啊!
不！

19:14.068 --> 19:16.068
No, no, no, no,
no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，
不，不，不！

19:16.137 --> 19:19.551
One dollar?
一美元？

19:19.620 --> 19:23.137
[cries]
[哭声]

19:23.206 --> 19:26.275
- I demand a refund!
- 我要求退款！

19:26.344 --> 19:28.448
- Uh, what's the problem
here, sir?
- 呃，有什么问题吗
在这里，先生？

19:28.517 --> 19:31.586
- There is a hair
in my soup,
- 有一根头发
在我的汤里，

19:31.655 --> 19:34.241
and I demand a refund!
我要求退款！

19:34.310 --> 19:35.827
- Eh...
Ooh.
- 呃...
哦。

19:35.896 --> 19:39.517
Uh, well, that's not just
any hair, sir.
呃，好吧，这不仅仅是
任何头发，先生。

19:39.586 --> 19:43.034
It's from the elusive
Peruvian jelly-lope,
它来自难以捉摸的
秘鲁果冻，

19:43.103 --> 19:44.448
for flavor,
为了风味，

19:44.517 --> 19:46.896
and it's only an extra...
而且这只是一个额外的...

19:46.965 --> 19:50.965
$100 million charge?
Hm?
收费1亿美元？
嗯？

19:51.034 --> 19:54.275
- That seems
slightly exorbitant,
- 看来
稍微有点过高,

19:54.344 --> 19:56.896
but really, what's a measly
$100 million
但说实话，这算什么微不足道的事
1亿美元

19:56.965 --> 19:58.448
to someone like me?
对于像我这样的人？

19:58.517 --> 19:59.965
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

20:00.034 --> 20:01.965
- [scatting]
- [分散]

20:02.034 --> 20:03.344
- Ah, just as well.
- 啊，也好。

20:03.413 --> 20:05.344
I wasn't that hungry anyway.
反正我没那么饿。

20:05.413 --> 20:07.862
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

20:07.931 --> 20:10.862
[dejected musical cue]
[沮丧的音乐提示]

20:10.931 --> 20:13.862
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

20:13.931 --> 20:19.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:19.241 --> 20:21.172
- Someone order
a rusty cab?
- 有人订购
生锈的出租车？

20:21.241 --> 20:22.827
- I like string.
- 我喜欢绳子。

20:22.896 --> 20:25.068
